From db94047bd280e8ef8e4221a9334497bf29e1cb01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beardedeagle <randy@heroictek.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:57:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] build(deps): bump node-llama-cpp to 3.22.1

node-llama-cpp 3.18.1 bundles a llama.cpp build whose Metal tensor API
probe uses an 8x8 matmul descriptor. Current macOS Metal Performance
Primitives require M or N to be a multiple of 16, so the probe fails
and tensor kernels are disabled on Apple M5 GPUs. 3.22.1 probes with
16x16 and enables them.
---
